The National Security Agency (NSA) has awarded the organizing committee a grant
to help support junior faculty and graduate students to attend the ACA meeting.
No support can be confirmed until the final paperwork is completed (perhaps by
the end of April).  If you are interested in being helped, please send an email
request for support to Stanly Steinberg and Michael Wester (stanly@math.unm.edu
and wester@math.unm.edu) and indicate what type of support you need, e.g.,
registration or travel, and if you are a junior faculty member, student, or
other reasons you need help.
